    "en": {
      "name": "Voidvelg Whiterider",
      "effect": "This turn, this card's name becomes \"Voidvelg Palerider\". Then, excavate 3 cards from the top of your Deck and show them. You can add 1 \"Voidvelg Requiem\" or 1 DARK Attribute Galaxy Type Normal Monster from those cards to your hand. Place the rest of the cards on the bottom of your Deck in any order."
    },
    "ja": {
